256
00:16:55,092 --> 00:16:56,506
<i>Transmitiendo la
señal a través del dron.</i>

257
00:16:59,060 --> 00:17:00,130
<i>Objetivo localizado.</i>

258
00:17:00,818 --> 00:17:02,670
<i>El objetivo está a 3 kms
