282
00:22:37,781 --> 00:22:39,226
Simon Stulls.

283
00:22:41,422 --> 00:22:43,219
¿Su nombre es Simon Stulls?

284
00:22:57,462 --> 00:22:58,774
Simon Stulls.

285
