468
00:39:45,464 --> 00:39:46,535
Sí, señor.

469
00:40:13,165 --> 00:40:15,025
No, no, no, no, no.

470
00:40:15,212 --> 00:40:18,298
No, no, no, no, no.

471
00:40:18,462 --> 00:40:19,478
No.

472
00:40:48,249 --> 00:40:50,554
No, no, no, no.

473
